message: "If you use or refer to this project, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "NHS FHIR Quality Gateway: two-layer validation of NHS FHIR data"
abstract: >-
  Standards conformance (official HL7 FHIR validator, UK Core 2.0.2) and cross-resource business
  rules for FHIR R4 data, demonstrated on every GP practice in England from the NHS Organisation
  Data Service and on synthetic clinical messages.
